    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Expertise (1) in Arcana</p><p>You can extend the reach of your magic.</p><p>When you cast a spell, you may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> to extend the range of your spell. How far you can extend it depends on the original range of the spell.</p><ul><li><p>Touch -&gt; 10 spaces</p></li><li><p>10 spaces -&gt; 30 spaces</p></li><li><p>30 spaces -&gt; 50 spaces</p></li><li><p>Self -&gt; Cannot be extended</p></li></ul>",
